            <title>einsum</title>
            <link>https://blog.vllbc.top/einsum/</link>
            <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid>https://blog.vllbc.top/einsum/</guid>
            <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;einops.einsum calls einsum operations with einops-style named axes&#xA;indexing, computing tensor products with an arbitrary number of tensors.&#xA;Unlike typical einsum syntax, here you must pass tensors first, and then&#xA;the pattern.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Also, note that rearrange operations such&#xA;as &lt;code&gt;&#34;(batch chan) out&#34;&lt;/code&gt;, or singleton axes &lt;code&gt;()&lt;/code&gt;,&#xA;are not currently supported.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;爱因斯坦求和&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111211532.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt; &lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111211543.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item><item>
            <title>pack and unpack</title>
            <link>https://blog.vllbc.top/pack-and-unpack/</link>
            <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid>https://blog.vllbc.top/pack-and-unpack/</guid>
            <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;pack&#34;&gt;pack&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Packs several tensors into one. See einops tutorial for introduction&#xA;into packing (and how it replaces stack and concatenation).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111213846.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt; ## unpack &amp;gt;Unpacks a single tensor into several by&#xA;splitting over a selected axes. See einops tutorial for introduction&#xA;into packing (and how it replaces stack and concatenation).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111214147.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;figcaption aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;image.png&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item><item>
            <title>rearrange</title>
            <link>https://blog.vllbc.top/rearrange/</link>
            <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid>https://blog.vllbc.top/rearrange/</guid>
            <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;einops.rearrange is a reader-friendly smart element reordering for&#xA;multidimensional tensors. This operation includes functionality of&#xA;transpose (axes permutation), reshape (view), squeeze, unsqueeze, stack,&#xA;concatenate and other operations.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;代替reshape，给维度命名。可以用…代表不想动的维度。 &lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111210502.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt; &lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111210626.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item><item>
            <title>reduce</title>
            <link>https://blog.vllbc.top/reduce/</link>
            <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid>https://blog.vllbc.top/reduce/</guid>
            <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;einops.reduce combines rearrangement and reduction using&#xA;reader-friendly notation.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;reduce会使维度减少。 &lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111210806.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt; &lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111210816.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item><item>
            <title>repeat</title>
            <link>https://blog.vllbc.top/repeat/</link>
            <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid>https://blog.vllbc.top/repeat/</guid>
            <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;einops.repeat allows reordering elements and repeating them in&#xA;arbitrary combinations. This operation includes functionality of repeat,&#xA;tile, and broadcast functions.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;repeat是使维度增加，与reduce相反。 &lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111210915.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt; &lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250111210926.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt; ## 应用&#xA;比如说repeat_kv函数就可以用einops.repeat很方便的实现&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;sourceCode&#34; id=&#34;cb1&#34;&gt;&lt;pre&#xA;class=&#34;sourceCode python&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;sourceCode python&#34;&gt;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-1&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kw&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; repeat_kv(x: torch.Tensor, n_rep: &lt;span class=&#34;bu&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; torch.Tensor:&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-2&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-2&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;co&#34;&gt;&amp;quot;&amp;quot;&amp;quot;torch.repeat_interleave(x, dim=2, repeats=n_rep)&amp;quot;&amp;quot;&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-3&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-3&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    bs, slen, n_kv_heads, head_dim &lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; x.shape&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-4&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;cf&#34;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; n_rep &lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-5&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-5&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;span class=&#34;cf&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; x&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-6&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-6&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;cf&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-7&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-7&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;        x[:, :, :, &lt;span class=&#34;va&#34;&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;, :]&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-8&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-8&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;        .expand(bs, slen, n_kv_heads, n_rep, head_dim)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-9&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-9&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;        .reshape(bs, slen, n_kv_heads &lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; n_rep, head_dim)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-10&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-10&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    )&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;等价于&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;sourceCode&#34; id=&#34;cb2&#34;&gt;&lt;pre&#xA;class=&#34;sourceCode python&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;sourceCode python&#34;&gt;&lt;span id=&#34;cb2-1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb2-1&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kw&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; repeat_kv(x: torch.Tensor, n_rep: &lt;span class=&#34;bu&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; torch.Tensor:&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb2-2&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb2-2&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;    einops.repeat(x, &lt;span class=&#34;st&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;bs slen kvheads dim-&amp;gt; bs slen (kvheads n_rep) dim&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, n_rep&lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;n_rep).shape&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item><item>
            <title>asnumpy</title>
            <link>https://blog.vllbc.top/asnumpy/</link>
            <pubDate>Wed, 08 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid>https://blog.vllbc.top/asnumpy/</guid>
            <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Convert a tensor of an imperative framework&#xA;(i.e. numpy/cupy/torch/jax/etc.) to &lt;code&gt;numpy.ndarray&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;img&#xA;src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vllbc/img4blog//image/20250108154828.png&#34;&#xA;alt=&#34;image.png&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;figcaption aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;image.png&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item><item>
            <title>parse_shape</title>
            <link>https://blog.vllbc.top/parse_shape/</link>
            <pubDate>Wed, 08 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid>https://blog.vllbc.top/parse_shape/</guid>
            <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Parse a tensor shape to dictionary mapping axes names to their&#xA;lengths.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;sourceCode&#34; id=&#34;cb1&#34;&gt;&lt;pre&#xA;class=&#34;sourceCode python&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;sourceCode python&#34;&gt;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-1&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;co&#34;&gt;# Use underscore to skip the dimension in parsing. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-2&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-2&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; x &lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; np.zeros([&lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;]) &lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; parse_shape(x, &lt;span class=&#34;st&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;batch _ h w&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;) {&lt;span class=&#34;st&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;batch&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&#34;st&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;h&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&#34;st&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;w&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;} &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-3&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-3&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;co&#34;&gt;# `parse_shape` output can be used to specify axes_lengths for other operations: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-4&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; y &lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; np.zeros([&lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;700&lt;/span&gt;]) &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-5&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-5&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; rearrange(y, &lt;span class=&#34;st&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;(b c h w) -&amp;gt; b c h w&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&#34;op&#34;&gt;**&lt;/span&gt;parse_shape(x, &lt;span class=&#34;st&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;b _ h w&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;)).shape &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;span id=&#34;cb1-6&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cb1-6&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; tabindex=&#34;-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;(&lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&#34;dv&#34;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;也就是把维度的维数映射到对应的命名。与数据无关，只看得到维度。&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item></channel>
